    "title": "Four Dow athletes sign to play in college - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Fred Kelly ,\n1 hours ago Ella Stoney (Photo provided by Midland Public Schools) Four Dow High student-athletes signed a National Letter of Intent on Wednesday to continue their playing careers at the collegiate level.\nElla Stoney signed to play softball at Saginaw Valley State University, while Tessa Fleming will play women’s lacrosse at Northern Michigan University, Cerae DeJongh will play softball at Delta College, and Selah Tonk will play softball at Mid Michigan College.\nSign up for Midland Daily News newsletters here\nRead the original article on ourmidland.com",
